    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d564">

                <pb facs="0674" n="578" xml:id="pg578"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Merry.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1899-05-02"><hi rendition="#italic">May 2,
                        1899</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Full instructions regarding duplicate payments mailed April 17. Urge equities in
                    favor of merchants at least until the two Governments can reach an
                    understanding.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hay.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
